{"Title":"An Act relative to creditable service for Wayne Taylor\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n","BillNumber":"H5065","DocketNumber":"HD5276","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"PrimarySponsor":{"Id":"DTV1","Name":"David T. Vieira","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/DTV1","ResponseDate":"2024-07-22T15:02:01.857"},"Cosponsors":[{"Id":"DTV1","Name":"David T. Vieira","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/DTV1","ResponseDate":"2024-07-22T15:02:01.8566667"}],"JointSponsor":null,"BillHistory":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Documents/H5065/DocumentHistoryActions","LegislationTypeName":"Bill","Pinslip":"By Representative Vieira of Falmouth, a petition (subject to Joint Rule 12) of David T. Vieira (with the approval of the board of regional county commissioners) that Wayne Taylor be authorized to purchase creditable service from the Barnstable County Retirement Board.  Public Service.","DocumentText":"\tSECTION 1. Notwithstanding any general or special law to the contrary, the Barnstable county retirement board shall permit Wayne Taylor, a member of the Barnstable county retirement system, to purchase creditable service for his Select Person time pursuant to paragraph (a) of subdivision (1) of section 4 of chapter 32 of the General Laws. \r\n","EmergencyPreamble":null,"RollCalls":[],"Attachments":[],"CommitteeRecommendations":[{"Action":"Suspend Rules","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"H33","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/H33"},"Votes":[]},{"Action":"Accompanied","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"J23","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/J23"},"Votes":[]},{"Action":"Favorable","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"H33","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/H33"},"Vote